# Packaging changelog

## 1.0.1-1

- Upstream bump: v0.4.0 -> v1.0.1.
- System service now runs as `pl4yrs` (local patch in `patches/`); sysusers
  only adds `pl4yrs` to the `audio` group.
- postinst removes the legacy `sendspin-cli` account on upgrade.

## 0.4.0-1

- First release: sendspin-cli v0.4.0 (Sendspin 1.0.0-rc1) for arm64,
  built from source in a debian:trixie arm64 container. Trixie only.
